cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Bangkok 3D — Interactive Urban Tourist Guide & Explorer Studio"
abstract: >-
  A static, bilingual Three.js miniature of Bangkok with five procedural landmarks,
  drone, drag-to-look walking and automated river-tour camera modes, three lighting
  presets, spatial Web Audio synthesis, localStorage progress and portable JSON
  itinerary export/import.
type: software
